[Music]  iconic nba star bill russell has died  he was 88 years old  i never felt like i was making the  contribution  i was just doing the best i could  bill's family shared the news to social  media  in a statement they revealed he died  peacefully on sunday with wife janine at  his side  no cause of death is known at this time  bill's one of the most celebrated  figures in sports history he was an 11  time nba champion he led the usa's gold  medal winning basketball team at the  1956 olympics  as a player bill's entire nba career was  with the boston celtics  later making history with his last two  seasons on the court  while both coaching and playing bill  became the first blackhead coach of any  northern american professional sports  team  the nba community took to social media  with tributes magic johnson wrote on  twitter quote bill russell was my idol  and noted quote off the court bill  russell paved the way for guys like me  dwayne wade shared this photo to his  instagram story calling bill a quote  pioneer  former president barack obama tweeted  quote today we lost a giant as tall as  bill russell stood his legacy rises far  higher both as a player and as a person  obama previously honored bill with the  presidential medal of freedom in 2011.  this year's medal of freedom recipients  reveal the best of who we are  and who we aspire to be more than any  athlete of his era bill russell came to  define the word winner he made a point  to reflect on bill's work as a civil  rights advocate  he marched with king  he stood by ali  when a restaurant refused to serve the  black celtics he refused to play in the  scheduled game  he endured insults and vandalism but he  kept on focusing on making the team  teammates who he loved  better players  and made possible the success of so many  who would follow  you

